  "scope": "Supplement for skipping only an identity mark/tatweel removal pass on exact built-in strings. Existing Unicode acceptance stays unchanged; non-exact-str values retain the old iteration/join semantics. This is the internal tokens helper domain, not expansion of the UTF-8 query API.",
